 against the AI on hand-built maps or generated ones in nine terrain styles, for 2 to 8 commanders. Set teams, start positions, colours, army size and bot difficulty for each seat. Ascendancy and Annihilation, plus optional Horde Attacks from the moon's na","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:00:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691311","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:11:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4944650-1846651706689148","game_id":"steam-4944650","kind":"announcement","title":"IronFlux 0.1.19: New Training, a New Economy and Smarter Bots","summary":"IronFlux 0.1.19 is out now for the full game, the Demo, the Playtest and the IronFlux Map Editor. It brings together everything from 0.1.16 to 0.1.19: new training missions, a new economy, smarter bots and a much bigger FIELD WIKI. Here's what has changed since our last update (0.1.15). Training, rebuilt Basic Training grows from three missions to seven. Four new drills sit between Boot Camp and First Capture: Power Up (income), Bank and Balance (storage and spending), Production Line (queues an","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T07:48:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706689148","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:11:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4944650-1846018067936645","game_id":"steam-4944650","kind":"announcement","title":"IronFlux 0.1.15: Replies In Game, Replays That Keep Working, and Smarter Armies","summary":"IronFlux 0.1.15 is out, bringing everything from 0.1.11 and 0.1.12 together with a new way to hear back from us about your reports. Here's what has changed since our last update. Talk to us from inside the game Replies to your reports: when we answer a problem report you sent (F8 or REPORT A PROBLEM), the main menu shows REPLY FROM THE IRONFLUX TEAM. Replies appear in your game language, with the English original underneath. MY REPORTS: see every report you've sent from your PC. Click one to see","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-10T16:26:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067936645","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:11:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4944650-1846018067931927","game_id":"steam-4944650","kind":"announcement","title":"IronFlux 0.1.10: Faster Battles, Cleaner Controls, a New Map Editor","summary":"Commanders, two updates have landed since our last post. Here is what changed in 0.1.9 and 0.1.10. Big battles run smoother Late-game fights with thousands of units now run about three times faster. Four-player matches stay responsive when every army is at full strength. Every key does one thing P now only pauses. The Pyre moved to Space. Ctrl+B and Ctrl+V are only the blueprint keys. For endless Builder or Artillery production, Ctrl+click the button in the build panel. The pause menu no longer ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-09T02:00:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067931927","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:11:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4944650-1845383656390854","game_id":"steam-4944650","kind":"update","title":"IronFlux Demo 0.1.5: Major Update, Available Until 1.0","summary":"The IronFlux demo is now on version 0.1.5, the same build as the full game, with a lot of new things to try. The demo stays available until 1.0 Once it's out, the demo isn't going anywhere: it will stay available on Steam until IronFlux reaches 1.0, and it's updated alongside the full game as it grows. What's new in the demo New map system: a map browser with filters and a larger preview, plus VIEW MAP to inspect the whole battlefield before the match starts: every start, metal deposit, power ve","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-04T09:26:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656390854","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:11:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4944650-1845383656390849","game_id":"steam-4944650","kind":"announcement","title":"IronFlux 0.1.5: New Maps, Summit Walls and Smarter Bots","summary":"Commanders, 0.1.5 is the biggest update to IronFlux so far. It brings everything from our recent playtest builds: a new map system, smarter bots, new upgrades and a cleaner set of menus. Here is what's new, and what we're building next. A new map system Map browser with ALL / BUILT-IN / WORKSHOP / CUSTOM filters and a larger pop-out preview. VIEW MAP: look over the whole battlefield before the match starts. Zoom, scroll, and see every start position, metal deposit, power vent and flux source. Ma","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-04T09:26:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656390849","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:11:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4944650":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T15:36:48Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T15:36:48Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4944650":"2026-10-26T15:36:48Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4944650":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T15:36:48Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T15:36:48Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T15:36:48Z"},"5282740":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T15:36:48Z","last_success_at